        83.57433319091797,
        485.5453186035156,
        97.6623306274414
      ],
      "text": "samples in people with signs and symptoms of pulmonary TB for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        97.97423553466797,
        503.4662170410156,
        112.0622329711914
      ],
      "text": "detection of resistance to isoniazid, as compared with culture-based",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        112.37419891357422,
        209.55862426757812,
        126.46219635009766
      ],
      "text": "phenotypic DST?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        137.16522216796875,
        527.1134033203125,
        150.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "A total of 18 studies with 1758 specimens provided data for resistance testing of isoniazid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        152.66522216796875,
        526.9904174804688,
        165.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "using moderate complexity automated NAATs ( ). Of these 18 studies, nine were  Fig. 2.1.2.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.16522216796875,
        526.8189086914062,
        181.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "conducted on the Abbott RealTi e RIF/INH test, three on FluoroType MTBDR, four on BD  m",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.66522216796875,
        526.63623046875,
        196.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "MAX and two on the cobas MTB-RIF/INH test. The reference standard for each of these studies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987692832946777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.16522216796875,
        526.9644775390625,
        212.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "for resistance detection was phenotypic DST, and a composite reference standard with both",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        214.66522216796875,
        265.75048828125,
        227.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "phenotypic DST and sequencing results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.66912841796875,
        526.9590454101562,
        251.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "Eight (44%) of the 18 studies had high or unclear risk of bias, because participant selection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        254.16912841796875,
        417.2621154785156,
        267.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "was not reported or prior testing was done on the included specimens.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.955322265625,
        501.5340881347656,
        296.0433044433594
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 2.1.2.3 Forest plot of included studies for isoniazid resistance detection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.455322265625,
        338.23809814453125,
        311.5433044433594
      ],
      "text": "with phenotypic DST as the reference standard",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.2776184082031,
        526.5016479492188,
        513.0325927734375
      ],
      "text": "CI: confidence interval; DST: drug susceptibility testing; FN: false negative; FP: false positive; RIF: rifampicin; TB:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.07763671875,
        263.2951354980469,
        523.8325805664062
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis; TN: true negative; TP: true positive.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        540.8408203125,
        526.9038696289062,
        553.98583984375
      ],
      "text": "The overall sensitivity for isoniazid resistance in these 18 studies ranged from 58% to 100%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.3408203125,
        524.4234008789062,
        569.48583984375
      ],
      "text": "and the specificity from 94% to 100%.  The pooled sensitivity was 86.4% (95% CI: 82.1–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.9948120117188,
        421.260009765625,
        584.9088134765625
      ],
      "text": "89.8%) and the pooled specificity was 99.8% (95% CI: 98.3–99.8%).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.8447875976562,
        527.1796875,
        608.9898071289062
      ],
      "text": "In determining isoniazid resistance, the results from genetic sequencing (genotypic DST) were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998149871826172,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.3447875976562,
        526.9258422851562,
        624.4898071289062
      ],
      "text": "obtained where possible, and a composite reference standard was developed that combined",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.8447875976562,
        527.25439453125,
        639.9898071289062
      ],
      "text": "the results from phenotypic and genotypic DST. For detecting isoniazid resistance, the diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.3447875976562,
        502.9606628417969,
        655.4898071289062
      ],
      "text": "test accuracy of phenotypic DST was similar to that of the composite reference standard.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.8563842773438,
        246.438720703125,
        684.2363891601562
